{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"id":1,"title":2,"inWords":3,"equation":4,"parameters":5,"outputs":9,"results":11,"assumptions":14,"buildsOn":17,"sameDomain":18,"citation":37,"learnMore":38},"gravity-assist","중력 도움","행성 기준계에서 플라이바이는 탄성 충돌과 같습니다 — 들어올 때 속도와 나갈 때 속도가 같습니다. 완전히 180° 방향을 틀면 행성에 대한 상대 속도가 뒤집히며, 태양 기준계에서는 Δv_max = 2v∞의 속도 변화가 됩니다. 우주선은 속도를 공짜로 얻고, 행성은 측정할 수 없을 만큼 작은 반동으로 값을 치릅니다.","\u003Cspan class=\"katex-display\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ\u003C/mi>\u003Cmsub>\u003Cmi>v\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi>max\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>⁡\u003C/mo>\u003C/msub>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003Cmtext> \u003C/mtext>\u003Cmsub>\u003Cmi>v\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞\u003C/mi>\u003C/msub>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta v_{\\max} = 2\\,v_\\infty\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">Δ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"msupsub\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mop mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mtight\">m\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mtight\">a\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mtight\">x\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-s\">